<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Myriad Genetics started buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Myriad Genetics started buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Montgomery Securities said on Thursday its analyst David Crossen initiated coverage of Myriad Genetics with a buy rating on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Crossen gave the stock a $41 target price.</p>
<p>-- The stock was trading flat at 26-3/4 on Thursday.</p>
</text>
